#: ../../../SecurityTransparencyReports.md:79
msgid ""
"<https://bugs.chromium.org/p/llvm/issues/detail?id=17> reports a miscompile "
"in LLVM that can result in the frame pointer and return address being "
"overwritten. This was fixed. Redirect: <https://issuetracker.google.com/"
"issues/42410008> archive: <https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/"
"issues/127645>"
